flowchart LR
    DEV[Developer Commit]
    GIT[Proprietary Git Platform]
    BUILD[Build]
    UNIT[Unit Tests]
    CONTRACT[Contract and Adapter Tests]
    INTEG[Service Integration Tests with Doubles]
    PACKAGE[Package Immutable Artifacts]
    DEPLOYDEV[Deploy to Nonprod Env A]
    SMOKE1[Smoke and API Checks]
    DEPLOYTEST[Promote Same Artifact to Nonprod Env B]
    SMOKE2[Smoke and Integration Checks]
    DEPLOYSTAGE[Promote Same Artifact to Nonprod Env C]
    SMOKE3[Acceptance Checks]

    CONFIG[Externalized Environment Configuration]

    DEV --> GIT
    GIT --> BUILD
    BUILD --> UNIT
    UNIT --> CONTRACT
    CONTRACT --> INTEG
    INTEG --> PACKAGE

    PACKAGE --> DEPLOYDEV
    CONFIG --> DEPLOYDEV
    DEPLOYDEV --> SMOKE1

    SMOKE1 --> DEPLOYTEST
    CONFIG --> DEPLOYTEST
    DEPLOYTEST --> SMOKE2

    SMOKE2 --> DEPLOYSTAGE
    CONFIG --> DEPLOYSTAGE
    DEPLOYSTAGE --> SMOKE3